@startuml
state Setup {
  [*] --> Setup
}
state Active
state PreparingAdverts
state SchedulingAdverts
state RunningAdverts
state Adjustment
state Completing
state PaymentHandling
state OverpaymentHandling
state Paid
state Archive

Setup --> Active : Approval, Contract Signed
Active --> PreparingAdverts : Prepare Adverts
PreparingAdverts --> SchedulingAdverts : Adverts Ready
SchedulingAdverts --> RunningAdverts : Schedule Adverts
RunningAdverts --> Adjustment : Extension Requested
Adjustment --> RunningAdverts : Adjustments Complete
RunningAdverts --> Completing : All Adverts Finished
Completing --> PaymentHandling : Prepare Final Statement
PaymentHandling --> OverpaymentHandling : Generate Refund
OverpaymentHandling --> Paid : Balance Settled
Paid --> Archive : Full Payment Received

@enduml
